 on\, USA\nTopics: Control & Robotics\, Complex Systems & Network Science\
 , Machine Learning\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nSize: L\nSubmissi
 on type: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-0
 7\nNotes: Organizer date table confirms October 4-7 (society calendar has
