DTSTART:20260526T115900Z
DTEND:20260526T125900Z
SUMMARY:[Machine Learning][Control & Robotics] CoRL 2026 - Mandatory abstra
 ct registration deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Conference on Robot Learning\nWebsite: https:
 //www.corl.org/\nSource URL: https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learni
 ng.org/CoRL/2026/Conference\nLocation: Austin\, Texas\, USA\nTopics: Mach
 ine Learning\, Control & Robotics\, Reinforcement Learning\, Deep Represe
 ntation Learning\nSize: L\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nConfidence: conf
 irmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Tenth annual edition\; main 
 conference Nov 9-11 and workshops Nov 12. OpenReview's May 26/29 at 11:59
  UTC correspond to May 25/28 at 23:59 AoE\, consistent with the author in
 structions' Thursday May 28 cutoff. Abstract registration is mandatory. S
 atellite workshop papers are not main-track opportunities. ICORE 2026 lis
 ts CoRL as Unranked\, not A/A*/B/C. Size L is an editorial estimate.\nSco
 pe: Machine learning for physical robots\, especially imitation and reinf
 orcement learning\, learned perception and control\, robot foundation mod
 els\, and learning-based task and motion planning. Includes uncertainty\,
  generalization\, safety\, human-robot interaction\, and datasets grounde
 d in manipulation\, navigation\, or locomotion. General ML is relevant wh
 en it makes a substantive contribution to robot learning.\nAdditional top
 ics: Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition\, Probabilistic\, Causal & Unc
 ertainty ML\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\, Robustness & Safety\, L
 earning Theory & Statistical Foundations\nScope sources (2026): https://w
 ww.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2026/Conference
END:VEVENT
